{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id488725078"}, "name":{"label":"Ruthanne Reid"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-13T11:02:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"13954397876"}, "title":{"label":"Finally, a good bullet journal app - and no subscription!"}, "content":{"label":"So many bujo apps take all your data, or simply are not flexible  or lack basic features like repeating daily tasks. \n\nNot this one. \n\nI have tried just about everything, including apps that try to mimic the bullet journal concept, but this one honestly provides what’s needed. The projects are equivalent to collections. Daily tasks can be repeated or grouped. It’s great.\n\nAnd to top it off, no subscription?  Funny how that makes me say “take my money.”\n\nThanks for the great app, devs. May your pillowcase always be cool.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1611547494"}, "name":{"label":"Chizuui"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-04T17:36:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"13923412348"}, "title":{"label":"So Close to Perfect"}, "content":{"label":"I only use this for repeating events/tasks. Which is amazing, but a little clunky. I really wish I could more easily move task date to sooner or later since it just hits you with a \"pause\" or \"change\" on the recurring options, not the actual date. I would also like to move things around in the \"Upcoming\" menu since I like that view to know how packed I made a day, and want to rearrange items to ease the load.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id571411124"}, "name":{"label":"Rabbit Reader II"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-04T12:09:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"13922632983"}, "title":{"label":"My GO TO DO list"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used several task apps but I like the ease of using Things3. I use it daily because it sure beats paper. I like the tutorials they provide. The only thing the app needs work is the ability to share a photo, like a texted invite photo with dates and times etc. to the things list in a much simpler quicker easier way, ie- please write that software so it can be automatic. I’m getting tired of rewriting data when I could send a picture instead.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
