{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id526531071"}, "name":{"label":"csageland"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-01T08:14:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.8"}, "id":{"label":"13802794695"}, "title":{"label":"balance of simplicity, beauty, design and function hits all the right notes"}, "content":{"label":"Just got this set up, but the balance of simplicity, beauty, design and function hits all the right notes. The only thing I change immediately is that flags are deadlines rather than priority flags, which is weird and annoying. But this was clearly built for people who can get lost working on systems rather than working on work and the flow to focus on the work that needs to get done.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id211554215"}, "name":{"label":"Dan804584325"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-28T06:48:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.8"}, "id":{"label":"13798776523"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic for GTD"}, "content":{"label":"Great app. I’m using it on an iPhone 15 pro. Works great and a good tool that is in line with David Allen’s Getting Things Done methodology.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id36960979"}, "name":{"label":"tuxtlequino"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-23T14:10:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.7"}, "id":{"label":"13781916459"}, "title":{"label":"Just practical"}, "content":{"label":"I think that the problem with most apps that mean to help you organize your life is the user. No app will help you change ingrained patterns. But I like this app because it doesn’t get o. The way. It is powerful. It is simple. May not be for you but it is perfect for what it does and means to do.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id204116620"}, "name":{"label":"snailruns"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-17T21:28:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13761470144"}, "title":{"label":"Feature request: flagged"}, "content":{"label":"Please add a flag feature so we can further highlight important tasks", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id6006376"}, "name":{"label":"qmost72703"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-06T11:13:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13720315692"}, "title":{"label":"Loving it"}, "content":{"label":"I have been a big fan of OmniFocus for years. It’s such a powerful tool and I fell in love with how it lets you customize. After getting frustrated at one of the sync issues that happens on that platform, I tried Things and, for my purposes, I have found a home. The extra capabilities in OmniFocus now feel like bloat and I find Things does everything I need without asking me to invest so much of myself in maintaining it. No disrespect for OF or those who prefer it, but things is a much better fit for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id43082179"}, "name":{"label":"Cliffv12"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-04T15:30:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13713604034"}, "title":{"label":"Be ready to spend a lot and not be able to share with others"}, "content":{"label":"I saw all the great reviews and was super excited to buy this app and organize my life! And yes, it’s a great app to organize projects and tasks however it has some serious shortcomings, especially given the exorbitant costs. \n\nFirst, you can’t share with a family member so having a shared family to do list in one app is impossible with this app. The only work around is sharing a log in, which then floods your phone with notifications for someone else’s tasks! Come on, sharing seems like a fundamental function.\n\nSecond, say you don’t care about sharing but want an app for your Mac. I mean after all your integrated into this app, why wouldn’t you?! Yeah that’s going to cost you ANOTHER $50. That is absolutely insane and a primary reason I’m abandoning this app and recommending others who are looking for a to do app look elsewhere. \n\nGreat app, lacks basic sharing functionality and is incredibly greedy.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id179874652"}, "name":{"label":"Leavism"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-01T09:04:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13701575653"}, "title":{"label":"The perfect personal task manager"}, "content":{"label":"Things 3 is truly the perfect personal task manager, but it stops there. If you have no one else in your life that you need to share responsibilities with, then Things is without a doubt a 5/5, but rarely is that the case.\n\nI used Things 3 for 10 years, saving money on subscriptions because this is a one time purchase. It does everything right, from how stupid fast everything runs to yearly updates for the latest iOS releases. I just wish there were some collaborative features.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
