{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id942206829"}, "name":{"label":"Just_Girl_03"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-09T18:52:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13615437480"}, "title":{"label":"7 лет без крупных обновлений"}, "content":{"label":"Никаких новых функций, даже выбор порядка для новой задачи в разделе «сегодня»: хочу сверху вниз, а не снизу вверх.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id429627835"}, "name":{"label":"vargarchitecture"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-08T16:29:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13611166042"}, "title":{"label":"App doesn’t automatically refresh"}, "content":{"label":"The app does not refresh content automatically in the background. Updates only appear when you manually open the app, which is frustrating and interrupts workflow. Background refresh is expected in modern apps—this limitation significantly reduces usability and user experience. Please implement automatic background updates so content stays current without constant manual checking.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id114153291"}, "name":{"label":"revival20"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-07T19:51:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13607805000"}, "title":{"label":"Incredible usefulness"}, "content":{"label":"I didn’t think I will find this app so helpful. I gave it a chance after hesitation, but it’s really amazing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id199762483"}, "name":{"label":"Ablepraxis"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-04T19:37:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13596167008"}, "title":{"label":"Love it, but…"}, "content":{"label":"I firmly appreciate this app for smart design and features.  Its sorta understandable that paid app charges again for desktop version (iPad too i think) but with that being the case: \nmy one major wish/request is that developers produce options for proper WIDGET\nfor anyone working on desktop mac, maybe iphone too.\nRake in your earnings sure, but please consider the suggestion. Would give 5 stars for that!\nCheers!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
