{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1865189245"}, "name":{"label":"Emastsamyoder"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-31T07:33:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.6"}, "id":{"label":"13577322304"}, "title":{"label":"Best organizing app"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using this app for personal organization for some years now(since the download was free). I recently started a job with a dedicated cell line and tried other apps to manage my tasks, but none of them would suite. The charge for the app is well worth it to ensure that your tasks and projects stay up to date, organized, and that nothing falls through the cracks. For proper use of this app and to understand the underlying principles behind it, I recommend reading Getting Things Done by David Allen. Great system, great app, I highly recommend it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
