{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id18594787"}, "name":{"label":"teegraups"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-10T11:35:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.4"}, "id":{"label":"13381837555"}, "title":{"label":"The Thing is… it’s perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Things is exactly what I wanted and everything I didn’t know I needed. I don’t know how I lived without Things… actually I do and it was wasting so much time manually tracking my to dos and getting overwhelmed with all the different things I had going on in life! Things is perfect—everything you need and nothing you don’t. Just buy it already! I even went a couple years before investing in the Mac companion and have zero regrets except I should have bought it sooner.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
